{"seq":3,"slug":"streaming-deadline-cancel-status","title":"四种流式 RPC 与 deadline、取消、状态码语义","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/grpc-http2-microservice-communication-internals/grpc-service-stub-internals/streaming-deadline-cancel-status","wordCount":2498,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"四种流式-rpc-与-deadline-取消-状态码语义\">四种流式 RPC 与 deadline、取消、状态码语义</h1><p>跨境订单履约网关向仓储服务发起批量库存预留，客户在网络抖动中关掉了 App。这次调用既没有 deadline、也没把取消信号传到下游，于是预留继续在仓库端执行——用户看到失败，库存却被锁住，直到对账才被发现。gRPC 用一套贯穿客户端、服务端和中间代理的语义解决这类问题：方法类型决定消息怎么流，deadline 决定它活多久，取消决定它怎么停，状态码决定它为什么停。三者是同一条 RPC 生命周期上的三个刻度。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-方法类型-元数据通道与状态骨架\">核心概念：方法类型、元数据通道与状态骨架</h2><p>方法类型由 <code>.proto</code> 里的 <code>stream</code> 关键字决定，共四种；区别不在业务语义，而在<strong>请求方向与响应方向各携带多少条消息</strong>，这条契约决定了双方在 HTTP/2 上怎么半关闭（half-close）自己的方向。每个 RPC 映射为<strong>一条 stream</strong>，遵循三段骨架：initial metadata（HEADERS 帧）、零到多个 DATA 帧（LEN 分隔的消息，编码见 <a href=\"protobuf-idl-codegen-wire\">Protobuf IDL、代码生成与线格式</a>），以及带 <code>END_STREAM</code> 的 trailers（HEADERS 帧），状态藏在 trailers 里——规范要求状态<strong>即使为 OK 也必须发在 trailers 中</strong>（<a href=\"https://github.com/grpc/grpc/blob/master/doc/PROTOCOL-HTTP2.md\">PROTOCOL-HTTP2.md</a>）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[&quot;客户端发起&lt;br/&gt;HEADERS + grpc-timeout&quot;] --&gt; B{&quot;方法类型?&quot;}&#10;    B --&gt;|&quot;unary / server streaming&quot;| C[&quot;1 请求 DATA&lt;br/&gt;half-close&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt;|&quot;client streaming&quot;| D[&quot;N 请求 DATA&lt;br/&gt;half-close&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt;|&quot;bidirectional&quot;| E[&quot;双向独立 DATA&lt;br/&gt;各自 half-close&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; F[&quot;服务端处理&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; F&#10;    E --&gt; F&#10;    F --&gt; G[&quot;响应 HEADERS + DATA 帧&quot;]&#10;    G --&gt; H[&quot;Trailers&lt;br/&gt;grpc-status + grpc-message&lt;br/&gt;+ END_STREAM&quot;]&#10;    H --&gt; I{&quot;status == 0 ?&quot;}&#10;    I --&gt;|&quot;是&quot;| J[&quot;消息交付应用&quot;]&#10;    I --&gt;|&quot;否&quot;| K[&quot;重试 / 上报 / 终止&quot;]&#10;    L[&quot;deadline 到期 / 主动取消&quot;] -.-&gt;|&quot;RST_STREAM CANCEL&quot;| F\">flowchart TD\n    A[\"客户端发起&lt;br/&gt;HEADERS + grpc-timeout\"] --&gt; B{\"方法类型?\"}\n    B --&gt;|\"unary / server streaming\"| C[\"1 请求 DATA&lt;br/&gt;half-close\"]\n    B --&gt;|\"client streaming\"| D[\"N 请求 DATA&lt;br/&gt;half-close\"]\n    B --&gt;|\"bidirectional\"| E[\"双向独立 DATA&lt;br/&gt;各自 half-close\"]\n    C --&gt; F[\"服务端处理\"]\n    D --&gt; F\n    E --&gt; F\n    F --&gt; G[\"响应 HEADERS + DATA 帧\"]\n    G --&gt; H[\"Trailers&lt;br/&gt;grpc-status + grpc-message&lt;br/&gt;+ END_STREAM\"]\n    H --&gt; I{\"status == 0 ?\"}\n    I --&gt;|\"是\"| J[\"消息交付应用\"]\n    I --&gt;|\"否\"| K[\"重试 / 上报 / 终止\"]\n    L[\"deadline 到期 / 主动取消\"] -.-&gt;|\"RST_STREAM CANCEL\"| F</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法类型</th>\n<th>proto 声明</th>\n<th>HTTP/2 帧形态</th>\n<th>跨境履约典型用法</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Unary</td>\n<td><code>rpc M(Req) returns (Resp)</code></td>\n<td>1 请求 DATA + trailers；1 响应 DATA + trailers</td>\n<td>查单个 SKU 的 ATP 库存</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Server streaming</td>\n<td><code>rpc M(Req) returns (stream Resp)</code></td>\n<td>1 请求 DATA + half-close；N 响应 DATA</td>\n<td>订阅轨迹推送</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Client streaming</td>\n<td><code>rpc M(stream Req) returns (Resp)</code></td>\n<td>N 请求 DATA + half-close；1 响应 DATA</td>\n<td>批量上传揽收记录换汇总</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Bidirectional</td>\n<td><code>rpc M(stream Req) returns (stream Resp)</code></td>\n<td>双向 N 条 DATA，各自 half-close</td>\n<td>报关单流式上传 + 校验回执</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>bidirectional 的两个方向<strong>互相独立</strong>：gRPC 只保证单条 RPC 内的消息顺序，不保证读写之间有时序耦合（<a href=\"https://grpc.io/docs/what-is-grpc/core-concepts/\">core-concepts</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"deadline-grpc-timeout-的编码与跨跳传播\">deadline：<code>grpc-timeout</code> 的编码与跨跳传播</h2><p><strong>gRPC 默认不设 deadline</strong>，客户端可无限等待（<a href=\"https://grpc.io/docs/guides/deadlines/\">deadlines</a>）。没有 deadline 的 unary 调用会把上游线程池、连接池和下游锁一并拖住，是生产事故最常见的根因之一。</p>\n<p>客户端把 deadline 编码进 <code>grpc-timeout</code> 请求头，格式是<strong>至多 8 位 ASCII 数字紧跟一个单位字符</strong>（<a href=\"https://github.com/grpc/grpc/blob/master/doc/PROTOCOL-HTTP2.md\">PROTOCOL-HTTP2.md</a>）。单位共六个：<code>H</code>/<code>M</code>/<code>S</code> 为时/分/秒，<code>m</code>/<code>u</code>/<code>n</code> 为毫秒/微秒/纳秒，<code>1S</code> 即 1 秒；该头缺失时服务端把超时视为无限。客户端本地持有<strong>绝对时刻</strong>（deadline），发送前换算成<strong>剩余时长</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>wire</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>deadline</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>now</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{\\text{wire}} = t_{\\text{deadline}} - t_{\\text{now}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">wire</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">deadline</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">now</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<p>这个换算不是实现细节而是正确性要求：传播逐跳做「减去已耗时」，设计理由正是<strong>规避时钟偏移</strong>——绝对时刻转成相对时长后，跨机器比较退化成同一条单调时钟上的减法。传播默认行为按语言而异：Java 和 Go 自动传播，<strong>C++ 需显式启用</strong>；Go 网关 + C++ 计算侧车这类混布必须逐跳核对，否则 C++ 那一跳会成为超时预算的黑洞。服务端收到已过期的 deadline 时不必等业务代码返回：runtime <strong>自动</strong>以 <code>CANCELLED</code> 取消该 RPC。但 gRPC 只取消 RPC 本身，<strong>不会</strong>替你停掉已启动的后台任务——长时间运行的 handler 必须自己周期性检查取消信号。</p>\n<h2 id=\"取消-rst_stream-与必须收尾的三处\">取消：<code>RST_STREAM</code> 与必须收尾的三处</h2><p>取消在 HTTP/2 层的表达是 <code>RST_STREAM</code> 帧。规范定义其错误码 <code>CANCEL (8)</code> 的语义：<strong>客户端发起的取消映射为「调用取消」，服务端发起的取消映射为 <code>CANCELLED</code> 状态</strong>——同一帧、同一错误码，方向决定上层看到的是「我主动放弃」还是「对方终止了我」（<a href=\"https://github.com/grpc/grpc/blob/master/doc/PROTOCOL-HTTP2.md\">PROTOCOL-HTTP2.md</a>）。</p>\n<p>取消的正确收尾要覆盖三处，缺一处就会留下资源泄漏：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>调用栈</strong>：handler 的 context / cancellation token 被置位，所有阻塞点（DB 查询、下游 RPC、channel 读写）都应以它为准退出。</li>\n<li><strong>下游扇出</strong>：本次 RPC 里发起的每次子调用都要带同一个 context，取消才会沿调用树传播——否则父调用被取消、子调用仍在跑，这正是「取消没穿透」的经典形态。</li>\n<li><strong>连接层</strong>：单条 stream 被 <code>RST_STREAM</code> 关闭，底层 HTTP/2 连接<strong>不受影响</strong>——同连接上其他并发的 RPC 继续正常传输（窗口分配见 <a href=\"../http2-transport-multiplexing/hpack-priority-flow-control\">HPACK、优先级与流量控制</a>）；连接级的 <code>GOAWAY</code> 则影响该连接上的所有流（处理见 <a href=\"../http2-transport-multiplexing/connection-goaway-keepalive-ops\">连接生命周期与 GOAWAY/Keepalive 运维</a>）。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>半关闭与取消要区分：client streaming 里客户端发完最后一条消息后 half-close，表示「我这边没更多了」，但<strong>响应方向仍然开放</strong>；只有 trailers 到达才是 RPC 的真正终点。bidirectional 的两个方向各自独立 half-close，任一侧提前结束都不代表整条 RPC 结束。</p>\n<h2 id=\"状态码-trailers-里的编码与-trailers-only-短路\">状态码：trailers 里的编码与 trailers-only 短路</h2><p>状态的载体是 trailers 里的三个头，编码规则狭窄且必须逐条遵守（<a href=\"https://github.com/grpc/grpc/blob/master/doc/PROTOCOL-HTTP2.md\">PROTOCOL-HTTP2.md</a>）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>trailers 头</th>\n<th>编码规则</th>\n<th>备注</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>grpc-status</code></td>\n<td>十进制 ASCII 整数，<strong>无前导零</strong></td>\n<td>必发，即使值为 0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>grpc-message</code></td>\n<td>先 UTF-8 再 percent-encoding</td>\n<td>接收方须容忍非法 percent 编码，不能因此丢弃整条 RPC</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>grpc-status-details-bin</code></td>\n<td>二进制 details</td>\n<td><strong>仅当状态非 OK</strong> 时出现，不得与 <code>grpc-status</code> 矛盾</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>调用立即失败时，规范允许一种短路形态——<strong>trailers-only response</strong>：响应只有一个 HEADERS 块，同时充当 HTTP 状态、content type 和 trailers。理由很直白：「trailers-only 允许用于产生立即错误的调用」，这在 <code>INVALID_ARGUMENT</code>、<code>UNAUTHENTICATED</code> 这类「连业务逻辑都没进」的失败上很常见，也为服务网格省掉一次 DATA 往返。</p>\n<p>canonical 状态码固定为 0–16 共 17 个（<a href=\"https://grpc.io/docs/guides/status-codes/\">status-codes</a>）。跨境履约里重试无意义的是 <code>INVALID_ARGUMENT (3)</code>、<code>PERMISSION_DENIED (7)</code>、<code>FAILED_PRECONDITION (9)</code>、<code>UNAUTHENTICATED (16)</code>；幂等时值得重试的是 <code>DEADLINE_EXCEEDED (4)</code>、<code>RESOURCE_EXHAUSTED (8)</code>、<code>UNAVAILABLE (14)</code>，而 <code>ABORTED (10)</code>（乐观锁冲突）需业务判断。<code>CANCELLED (1)</code> 是主动或 deadline 触发的取消，<code>INTERNAL (13)</code> 是服务端内部错误，<code>OK (0)</code> 为正常完成。其余六个——<code>UNKNOWN (2)</code>、<code>NOT_FOUND (5)</code>、<code>ALREADY_EXISTS (6)</code>、<code>OUT_OF_RANGE (11)</code>、<code>UNIMPLEMENTED (12)</code>、<code>DATA_LOSS (15)</code>——默认都不可重试。</p>\n<h2 id=\"重试与-hedging-deadline-跨越所有尝试\">重试与 hedging：deadline 跨越所有尝试</h2><p>状态码的真正消费者是重试策略，而 gRPC 的重试是<strong>默认关闭</strong>的。gRFC A6 明确：「除非服务拥有者在配置中指定策略，重试和 hedging 不会被启用」，启用后也只重试 <code>retryableStatusCodes</code> 里显式列出的码（<a href=\"https://github.com/grpc/proposal/blob/master/A6-client-retries.md\">gRFC A6</a>）。这与「网络库自动重试」的直觉相反，是刻意的保守设计——gRPC 没有幂等性标记，无法替业务判断重发是否安全。策略字段里有两条硬约束：<code>maxAttempts</code> 是<strong>含首次在内的总尝试次数</strong>，须为大于 1 的整数，且<strong>大于 5 的值按 5 处理而不报校验错误</strong>；其余四个字段（<code>initialBackoff</code>、<code>maxBackoff</code>、<code>backoffMultiplier</code>、<code>retryableStatusCodes</code>）必填且非空。第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 次重试的等待时间为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo fence=\"true\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">(</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>initial</mtext></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mi>m</mi><mrow><mtext> </mtext><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>max</mtext></msub><mo fence=\"true\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mi>r</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mi>r</mi><mo>∼</mo><mi>U</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0.8</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mn>1.2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_n = \\min\\bigl(t_{\\text{initial}} \\cdot m^{\\,n-1},\\ t_{\\text{max}}\\bigr) \\cdot r, \\qquad r \\sim U(0.8,\\ 1.2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mopen\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">initial</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2141em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mspace mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1952em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">max</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0.8</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.2</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span></span> 是 <code>backoffMultiplier</code>。抖动 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span> 不是可选项：大量客户端同时遭遇同一区域故障时，同步退避会造成整齐的重试风暴。服务端可用 <code>grpc-retry-pushback-ms</code> 指定下次延迟，不可解析或为负即告诉客户端<strong>不要重试</strong>。</p>\n<p>与取消/deadline 强相关的三条语义：<strong>deadline 跨越所有尝试</strong>——一旦到期，无论还剩几次尝试或多少个 in-flight hedge，整个 RPC 立即失败，超时预算不能「每次尝试各给一份」；<strong>committed 之后不可重试</strong>——RPC 在收到响应 headers、或待发消息超出客户端重试缓冲区的瞬间变为 committed，此后即便失败也不再重试，因为对端可能已开始处理，重发有重复副作用风险；<strong>transparent retry 不受策略控制</strong>——请求从未到达服务端应用逻辑时自动发生，而负载均衡器的 <code>DROP</code> 立即失败、<code>TRANSIENT_FAILURE</code> 才走策略。hedging 则是「在收到失败之前就重发」：原始 RPC 立即发出，其余副本按 <code>hedgingDelay</code> 扇出，任一成功即取消其他副本；它与重试策略<strong>互斥</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"工程落地-跨境链路的超时预算与状态码约定\">工程落地：跨境链路的超时预算与状态码约定</h2><p>把上述语义拼成运维约定，核心是<strong>超时预算的逐跳削减</strong>与<strong>状态码到重试动作的显式映射</strong>。网关给一次链路设总预算 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span>，每一跳的预算须严格小于上一跳剩余值，并预留序列化、网络与重试余量：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>hop</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>parent</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>elapsed</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>guard</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{hop}} = T_{\\text{parent}} - t_{\\text{elapsed}} - t_{\\text{guard}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">hop</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">parent</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9012em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">elapsed</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9012em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">guard</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>guard</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{\\text{guard}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9012em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">guard</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是给本跳自己留的收尾时间。省掉它，最常见的结果是子调用差几毫秒撞线、父调用先超时，日志上表现为「下游报 <code>DEADLINE_EXCEEDED</code>，上游报 <code>CANCELLED</code>」的错位噪声——两者其实是同一件事的两端。</p>\n<p>服务端方法应按语义<strong>主动分类</strong>错误，而不是一律 <code>UNKNOWN</code>/<code>INTERNAL</code>：参数问题用 <code>INVALID_ARGUMENT</code>（附 <code>grpc-status-details-bin</code> 里的 <code>BadRequest</code> details），限流用 <code>RESOURCE_EXHAUSTED</code>，状态机冲突用 <code>FAILED_PRECONDITION</code>。客户端只把 <code>UNAVAILABLE</code>、<code>RESOURCE_EXHAUSTED</code> 与幂等方法上的 <code>DEADLINE_EXCEEDED</code> 列入 <code>retryableStatusCodes</code>；跨境支付、清关这类<strong>非幂等</strong>写操作，宁可返回明确失败让人工介入，也不要靠重试掩盖不确定结果。最后，把 deadline 当作 API 契约评审：新增对外 gRPC 方法时，编码规范应要求客户端显式设置 deadline、服务端 handler 检查取消，否则一个区域的网络劣化就能通过没有边界的等待，把整条链路的线程池逐层耗尽。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>四种方法类型是<strong>消息条数与方向的契约</strong>，都映射到 HTTP/2 一条 stream；状态永远发在 trailers 里，即使 <code>OK</code> 也一样。</li>\n<li>deadline 编码为 <code>grpc-timeout</code>（≤8 位数字 + <code>H/M/S/m/u/n</code> 单位），传播时逐跳转成剩余时长并扣减已耗时以规避时钟偏移；gRPC <strong>默认不设 deadline</strong>，Java/Go 自动传播而 C++ 需显式启用。</li>\n<li>取消是 <code>RST_STREAM</code> 的 <code>CANCEL (8)</code>：客户端发起映射为调用取消，服务端发起映射为 <code>CANCELLED</code>；deadline 过期时 runtime 自动取消，但后台任务必须由应用自己停；单流关闭不影响同连接其他 RPC。</li>\n<li>状态码 0–16 共 17 个，配合 <code>grpc-message</code> 与 <code>grpc-status-details-bin</code> 构成错误契约；立即失败可用 trailers-only 短路。</li>\n<li>重试默认关闭，<code>maxAttempts</code> 上限为 5，退避必须带 ±20% 抖动；deadline 跨越所有尝试，收到响应 headers 后即 committed 且不可再重试，hedging 与重试互斥。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"四种流式 RPC 与 deadline、取消、状态码语义","id":"四种流式-rpc-与-deadline-取消-状态码语义"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：方法类型、元数据通道与状态骨架","id":"核心概念-方法类型-元数据通道与状态骨架"},{"level":2,"text":"deadline：`grpc-timeout` 的编码与跨跳传播","id":"deadline-grpc-timeout-的编码与跨跳传播"},{"level":2,"text":"取消：`RST_STREAM` 与必须收尾的三处","id":"取消-rst_stream-与必须收尾的三处"},{"level":2,"text":"状态码：trailers 里的编码与 trailers-only 短路","id":"状态码-trailers-里的编码与-trailers-only-短路"},{"level":2,"text":"重试与 hedging：deadline 跨越所有尝试","id":"重试与-hedging-deadline-跨越所有尝试"},{"level":2,"text":"工程落地：跨境链路的超时预算与状态码约定","id":"工程落地-跨境链路的超时预算与状态码约定"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"存根与通道内部：调用生命周期、元数据传递与上下文传播","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/grpc-http2-microservice-communication-internals/grpc-service-stub-internals/stub-channel-call-lifecycle"},"next":{"title":"重试、对冲与退避：重试预算与幂等性边界","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/grpc-http2-microservice-communication-internals/grpc-reliability-patterns/retry-hedging-backoff-budget"}}